OL,3,GNEWSAUncertainty over ticket refunds at
OL,4,Aclosed theatre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA ticketholder for a theatre
OL,7,Fperformance cancelled when a venue
OL,8,Fannounced its closure says she is
OL,9,Fdisappointed not to have been offered a
OL,10,Frefund yet.
OL,12,FSusan Fone said despite calling and
OL,13,Femailing the Brewhouse Theatre in
OL,14,FTaunton, Somerset, she has been unable
OL,15,Fto get in touch with anyone regarding
OL,16,Fher tickets for a festive performance
OL,17,Fof Treasure Island.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
