OL,3,GNEWSAUncertainty over ticket refunds at
OL,4,Aclosed theatre
OL,5,
OL,6,FFone told BBC Your Voice that she was
OL,7,Fnot informed of the theatre's closure
OL,8,Fover financial issues by the venue but
OL,9,Finstead found out in an online news
OL,10,Farticle.
OL,12,FTaunton Theatre Association (TTA) has
OL,13,Fadvised ticketholders to keep hold of
OL,14,Ftheir tickets for when the refunds
OL,15,Fprocess opens.
